{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26386754664251618", "organization": {"id": "441508825249822", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "26386754664251618"}]}, "id": "2159102491516592"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "9292506870770117"}]}, "id": "2853560194828967"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "7822981364474546"}]}, "id": "1249721416442138"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "26386754664251618", "release_date": 1773747120, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26663068766620205"}, "id": "1653829189365055"}]}}, "binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26386754664251618", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26663068766620205"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "id": "26663068766620205", "version": "1.0.7", "version_code": 8, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1775561453, "id": "26662472976679784", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v4", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 4, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "26662636089996806"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "26386754664251618"}, "id": "26662636089996806", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "26386754664251618", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1885230755691361"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ss11.png", "id": "2564854617242481", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620817_2564854620575814_6480617183322368310_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ig08zkO7UzsQ7kNvwE_Jzj9&_nc_oc=Adrrdt2kvGQaYVj4LExBBZ6yP7GsFttlg1ziC_JuwR9-asDixY8lU44VC4Qd8bEoxwY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1KR0zFaawAfbgH3tTk87Uaflu0yhkf8V2Am_FhxqYpOQ&oe=69DCEE03"}, {"file_name": "ss12.png", "id": "1456690712130534", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_1456690715463867_2923914872486225517_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rb4HXd4Bc-8Q7kNvwEAheuT&_nc_oc=Ado46xEIfxBnzj6ZJnUbAwQ3W8BpD9de5AG7caQVqlKhjrUtbAhZUyWsZ1KWEMTrneo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0waXoD6fC00turRl97bLHehB77qowh6y-x905btUr40Q&oe=69DCF4CB"}, {"file_name": "ss10.png", "id": "1335539158407857", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_1335539161741190_1225544957109827219_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6WFJKDzEVPEQ7kNvwHLjUwk&_nc_oc=AdpTF-p-fz7AyDbXMfxGWEZo693ZEnb6XVTH4glbVMtr5kKLrzKpH8L076f5jpP5v6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3Sx_HT4y0gcT-t9g70SP7GnuD8SdDZ5Lh-91ezbw4rcA&oe=69DCD31F"}]}, "id": "2472908293131255", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cup Strike", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Cup Strike est une exp\u00e9rience de tir immersive bas\u00e9e sur la physique, con\u00e7ue pour un gameplay captivant. Entrez dans un environnement virtuel dynamique o\u00f9 votre pr\u00e9cision et votre concentration sont mises \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9preuve en visant des tours de gobelets empil\u00e9s \u00e0 diff\u00e9rentes distances.\n\n{1456690712130534}\n\nChaque tir offre une physique r\u00e9aliste et satisfaisante \u2014 regardez les gobelets tomber, se disperser et s\u2019effondrer selon votre pr\u00e9cision et votre angle. Le jeu r\u00e9compense la pr\u00e9cision et la strat\u00e9gie, rendant chaque coup r\u00e9ussi gratifiant et chaque erreur utile pour progresser.\n\n{2564854617242481}\n\nLes joueurs peuvent personnaliser leur exp\u00e9rience en ajustant les couleurs du ciel, en modifiant les motifs des gobelets et en changeant la distance des tours pour contr\u00f4ler la difficult\u00e9. Que vous souhaitiez une session d\u00e9tendue ou un d\u00e9fi plus intense, le jeu s\u2019adapte \u00e0 votre style.\n\n{1335539158407857}\n\nLa r\u00e9initialisation instantan\u00e9e des tours garantit un gameplay fluide et sans interruption, permettant un entra\u00eenement continu ou une comp\u00e9tition pour les meilleurs scores sans attente.\n\nAvec plusieurs environnements et de nouvelles sc\u00e8nes ajout\u00e9es, Cup Strike VR offre vari\u00e9t\u00e9 et fra\u00eecheur visuelle \u00e0 chaque session. La combinaison de m\u00e9caniques simples, de contr\u00f4les r\u00e9actifs et d\u2019une physique immersive cr\u00e9e une exp\u00e9rience facile \u00e0 prendre en main mais difficile \u00e0 l\u00e2cher.\n\nQue vous cherchiez \u00e0 vous d\u00e9tendre ou \u00e0 battre des records, Cup Strike VR propose une boucle de jeu satisfaisante et addictive.", "short_description": "Cup Strike est un jeu de tir rapide bas\u00e9 sur la physique o\u00f9 vous visez des tours de gobelets empil\u00e9s \u00e0 diff\u00e9rentes distances. Testez votre pr\u00e9cision, faites tomber les gobelets avec une physique r\u00e9aliste et visez les meilleurs scores. Personnalisez les environnements, ajustez la difficult\u00e9 et r\u00e9initialisez instantan\u00e9ment pour continuer \u00e0 jouer."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ss12.png", "id": "1627138795270764", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618284_1627138798604097_2749878719314162201_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ocm02UVcTb0Q7kNvwESd_k-&_nc_oc=AdpctpWD8LbGUtiKEDo_MiSL1tAgYsuJ9YXXo7P4uJmmbSxxrjykdPxlK_OPgbiEKyg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2I8fPpiCW1R5UZ1MH2x6WgCQ-vM6zo2oBtGBUvhvTALA&oe=69DCF9B7"}, {"file_name": "ss10.png", "id": "1308542097797728", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623534_1308542104464394_3036847124162317759_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yZrFVN0DUeEQ7kNvwGHpsPm&_nc_oc=AdouEnckdshrmBy413ix7IuEvVvFigjekPmzGwrpAxnuviIHAzKGWMOOCYQZ_j6fG40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2A7YgABcl6C17myj2EsTvJqpB03fY0iE540kt4jq2DYw&oe=69DCD9A0"}, {"file_name": "ss11.png", "id": "937457849213474", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619145_937457855880140_4901934366269077737_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NCC06QGusRkQ7kNvwHzuN0K&_nc_oc=AdpLRYkDVzxR9y9TLCcckCcOEbRlfS0Hq1Ts2b4-xZxHK_bwbW39KmrK9UGnsMEUnnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2GCgEQ7tVCz4HKp7F2XlQeTYF10wiiEZvk_Bqk0beHWQ&oe=69DCDA3B"}]}, "id": "1277732780958598", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cup Strike", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Cup Strike \u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u57fa\u4e8e\u7269\u7406\u7684\u6c89\u6d78\u5f0f\u5c04\u51fb\u4f53\u9a8c\u6e38\u620f\u3002\u8fdb\u5165\u4e00\u4e2a\u52a8\u6001\u7684\u865a\u62df\u73af\u5883\uff0c\u5728\u4e0d\u540c\u8ddd\u79bb\u7784\u51c6\u5806\u53e0\u7684\u676f\u5b50\u5854\uff0c\u6311\u6218\u4f60\u7684\u7cbe\u51c6\u5ea6\u4e0e\u4e13\u6ce8\u529b\u3002\n\n\u6bcf\u4e00\u6b21\u5c04\u51fb\u90fd\u5e26\u6765\u771f\u5b9e\u4e14\u4ee4\u4eba\u6ee1\u610f\u7684\u7269\u7406\u6548\u679c\u2014\u2014\u770b\u7740\u676f\u5b50\u6839\u636e\u4f60\u7684\u89d2\u5ea6\u548c\u7cbe\u51c6\u5ea6\u5012\u4e0b\u3001\u6563\u843d\u548c\u5d29\u584c\u3002\u6e38\u620f\u5f3a\u8c03\u7cbe\u51c6\u4e0e\u7b56\u7565\uff0c\u8ba9\u6bcf\u4e00\u6b21\u547d\u4e2d\u90fd\u5145\u6ee1\u6210\u5c31\u611f\uff0c\u6bcf\u4e00\u6b21\u5931\u8bef\u90fd\u6210\u4e3a\u8fdb\u6b65\u7684\u673a\u4f1a\u3002\n{1627138795270764}\n\n\u73a9\u5bb6\u53ef\u4ee5\u901a\u8fc7\u8c03\u6574\u5929\u7a7a\u989c\u8272\u3001\u66f4\u6362\u676f\u5b50\u56fe\u6848\u4ee5\u53ca\u6539\u53d8\u5854\u7684\u8ddd\u79bb\u6765\u81ea\u5b9a\u4e49\u4f53\u9a8c\uff0c\u4ece\u800c\u63a7\u5236\u96be\u5ea6\u3002\u65e0\u8bba\u662f\u8f7b\u677e\u7ec3\u4e60\u8fd8\u662f\u9ad8\u96be\u5ea6\u6311\u6218\uff0c\u6e38\u620f\u90fd\u80fd\u9002\u5e94\u4f60\u7684\u73a9\u6cd5\u98ce\u683c\u3002\n\n{937457849213474}\n\u5373\u65f6\u91cd\u7f6e\u529f\u80fd\u8ba9\u6e38\u620f\u8fc7\u7a0b\u6d41\u7545\u4e0d\u4e2d\u65ad\uff0c\u65b9\u4fbf\u6301\u7eed\u7ec3\u4e60\u6216\u8fdb\u884c\u9ad8\u5206\u6311\u6218\uff0c\u65e0\u9700\u7b49\u5f85\u3002\n\n{1308542097797728}\n\u901a\u8fc7\u591a\u4e2a\u73af\u5883\u4ee5\u53ca\u65b0\u589e\u573a\u666f\uff0cCup Strike VR \u4e3a\u6bcf\u6b21\u6e38\u620f\u5e26\u6765\u4e30\u5bcc\u53d8\u5316\u548c\u89c6\u89c9\u65b0\u9c9c\u611f\u3002\u7b80\u5355\u7684\u673a\u5236\u3001\u7075\u654f\u7684\u63a7\u5236\u4ee5\u53ca\u6c89\u6d78\u5f0f\u7269\u7406\u6548\u679c\u76f8\u7ed3\u5408\uff0c\u4f7f\u6e38\u620f\u6613\u4e0a\u624b\u5374\u96be\u4ee5\u653e\u4e0b\u3002\n\n\u65e0\u8bba\u4f60\u662f\u60f3\u653e\u677e\u8fd8\u662f\u6311\u6218\u6700\u9ad8\u5206\uff0cCup Strike VR \u90fd\u80fd\u5e26\u6765\u4ee4\u4eba\u6ee1\u610f\u4e14\u4e0a\u763e\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u4f53\u9a8c\u3002\n\n\n", "short_description": "Cup Strike \u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u5feb\u8282\u594f\u7684\u57fa\u4e8e\u7269\u7406\u7684\u5c04\u51fb\u6e38\u620f\uff0c\u73a9\u5bb6\u9700\u8981\u4ece\u4e0d\u540c\u8ddd\u79bb\u7784\u51c6\u5806\u53e0\u7684\u676f\u5b50\u5854\u3002\u6d4b\u8bd5\u4f60\u7684\u7cbe\u51c6\u5ea6\uff0c\u7528\u771f\u5b9e\u7684\u7269\u7406\u6548\u679c\u51fb\u5012\u676f\u5b50\uff0c\u5e76\u6311\u6218\u66f4\u9ad8\u5206\u6570\u3002\u81ea\u5b9a\u4e49\u73af\u5883\uff0c\u8c03\u6574\u96be\u5ea6\uff0c\u5e76\u53ef\u5373\u65f6\u91cd\u7f6e\uff0c\u6301\u7eed\u7545\u73a9\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ss12.png", "id": "2175774379917399", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618103_2175774383250732_8076768027270501944_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qF80Hx7s-U8Q7kNvwFP0jl_&_nc_oc=Adqf0nPwEYeT4pFBktsYTW485Us-KVu-YbZFOXP3eWqKCdkCuLhjqaPgtDIpAley1ZE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3sZiBWWYzifWvjHBLiwfOcLlXp4Uz6gYfZa31XfKwmTQ&oe=69DCDB48"}, {"file_name": "ss11.png", "id": "2137699910339220", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618288_2137699913672553_7423868979154946533_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yVLY312lzeMQ7kNvwGULg77&_nc_oc=AdoP_3SuuWe8CbRIsMI38LHExuGOJW37P13ec5NMs95x_RrKRNkOUeTk7dKVZ66Wm4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3XKl4MkwahpaZ7uj2WUdMUA6ftBFuNrVPX_wcZyIMcIg&oe=69DCF30C"}, {"file_name": "ss10.png", "id": "1616871636189416", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499309561_1616871639522749_3073266000227229010_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oVy9sXeLQPwQ7kNvwGaPnnf&_nc_oc=AdoJpYS7cn18hgUz-CJSy1EYhlBibArsNXo-EPKEvCfu9lpWav3X-PQyv_MqGea22FA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0sbH4alxqWk2AispVuDxhjKRkmlJ7eSmoCzCgbhERZPg&oe=69DD0416"}]}, "id": "978796447820788", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cup Strike", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Cup Strike es una experiencia de disparos basada en f\u00edsica dise\u00f1ada para una jugabilidad inmersiva. Entra en un entorno virtual din\u00e1mico donde tu precisi\u00f3n y concentraci\u00f3n se ponen a prueba al apuntar a torres de vasos apilados a diferentes distancias.\n{2175774379917399}\nCada disparo ofrece una f\u00edsica realista y satisfactoria: observa c\u00f3mo los vasos caen, se dispersan y colapsan seg\u00fan tu precisi\u00f3n y \u00e1ngulo. El juego recompensa la precisi\u00f3n y la estrategia, haciendo que cada acierto sea impactante y cada fallo una oportunidad de mejorar.\n\n{2137699910339220}\n\nLos jugadores pueden personalizar su experiencia ajustando los colores del cielo, cambiando los patrones de los vasos y modificando la distancia de las torres para controlar la dificultad. Ya sea que busques una sesi\u00f3n relajada o un desaf\u00edo mayor, el juego se adapta a tu estilo.\n{1616871636189416}\n\nEl reinicio instant\u00e1neo de las torres mantiene la jugabilidad fluida y sin interrupciones, permitiendo practicar continuamente o competir por la puntuaci\u00f3n m\u00e1s alta sin esperas.\n\nCon m\u00faltiples entornos y nuevas escenas a\u00f1adidas, Cup Strike VR ofrece variedad y frescura visual en cada sesi\u00f3n. La combinaci\u00f3n de mec\u00e1nicas simples, controles precisos y f\u00edsica inmersiva crea una experiencia f\u00e1cil de aprender pero dif\u00edcil de dejar.\n\nYa sea para relajarte o competir por la mejor puntuaci\u00f3n, Cup Strike VR ofrece una experiencia de juego satisfactoria y adictiva.\n\n\n", "short_description": "Cup Strike es un juego de disparos r\u00e1pido basado en f\u00edsica donde apuntas a torres de vasos apilados desde diferentes distancias. Pon a prueba tu precisi\u00f3n, derriba los vasos con f\u00edsica realista y compite por las puntuaciones m\u00e1s altas. Personaliza los entornos, ajusta la dificultad y reinicia al instante para seguir jugando."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_